  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reinforcing the Facilitation Process btw the Govt of Sudan Armed groups</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will enhance the Mediation and Conflict Resolution roles and capacities of the South Sudan Facilitation Team (SSFT) and the Parties to sustain the negotiations between the GoS and the non-signatories to the Juba Peace Process &#x2013; in particular the Sudan People&#x2019;s Liberation Movement-North (SPLM-N). The project will focus on negotiation and mediation skills, strategies and approaches of the parties, confidence-building, issue-specific Workshops, on-going conflict and situation analysis to inform, and advise the SSFT to enhance its facilitation role, and shuttle diplomacy between the parties.</narrative>
  </description>
